An '''ambulance''' was a hovering vehicle used to [[transport]] sick or dying beings to a [[medcenter]].<ref name="The Perfect Weapon">"[[The Perfect Weapon]]"</ref> The [[Imperial ambunaut]] was a model of ambulance [[airspeeder]] used by the Galactic Empire to transport patients on [[Coruscant]].<ref name="MIS">{{Andor|Make It Stop}}</ref> An ambulance pulled up to help when [[Bazine Netal]] was [[poison]]ed with an unknown substance.<ref name="The Perfect Weapon" /> 

